   "text": "<chat>\n0+8|user: set up CI for the repo; kazuki: added ci.yml; ...\n8+4|user: move tests to bun test; tool: shell bun test ...\n12+2|user: why is e2e flaky?; kazuki: tmux pane not ready\n14+1|tool: shell {\"command\":\"bun test ./test/e2e\"}\n15+1|echo: 40 pass, 1 fail: timeout in origin.e2e.ts\n</chat>\nDevices open now:\n- mac-mini, work dir ~/.kazuki/work/main\nAgents at work now: none.\nTurn: the user's new message:\n\nfix the timeout",
