  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "build_t",
   "x": 840,
   "y": 790,
   "width": 620,
   "height": 110,
   "text": "new message \u2264512 B \u2192 it IS its line, no call\nnew message >512 B \u2192 'compress message 15'\ntwo sibling lines built \u2192 'merge 12+2, 14+2'\neach job: 1 call to the cheap model, no tools,\nsame system prompt; \u226464 jobs at once",
