  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "fit_t",
   "x": 840,
   "y": 950,
   "width": 620,
   "height": 110,
   "text": "each message appends one leaf at the END\nview > 128 KB \u2192 swap the oldest sibling pairs\nfor their parent until \u2264 64 KB (one batch)\nbetween batches the front never changes,\nso the vendor's prompt cache keeps hitting",
